%N A401595 Distance between n^3 and the nearest triangular number, either above or below n^3.
%F A401595 a(n) = A053616(n^3). - _Michel Marcus_, Oct 30 2026
%e A401595 a(3)=1 because the nearest triangular number to 3^3=27 is 28=7*8/2, thus the distance is 1.
%e A401595 a(16)=1 because the nearest triangular number to 16^3=4096 is 4095=90*91/2.
